    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <u><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into a modern world shattered by mystical artifacts. In <strong>Ready Beat Fire</strong>, every action\u2014your shots, enemies, environments, and even buffs\u2014syncs to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot to the rhythm, defeat foes, and evolve your abilities as you battle through dangerous places. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your runs, you'll find artifacts that grant you powers. Explore artifact combinations to create powerful builds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/0725b07be16dfd8c8de374ef74634012.poster.avif?t=1739929273\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/0725b07be16dfd8c8de374ef74634012.webm?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/0725b07be16dfd8c8de374ef74634012.mp4?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>UNLOCK NEW WAYS TO PLAY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons and abilities, each with its own unique traits and playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/2a263517e5f06a956ac4872304c56dd4.poster.avif?t=1739929273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/2a263517e5f06a956ac4872304c56dd4.webm?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/2a263517e5f06a956ac4872304c56dd4.mp4?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/10716e815c1d20be17c811ff055b0ed4.poster.avif?t=1739929273\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/10716e815c1d20be17c811ff055b0ed4.webm?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/10716e815c1d20be17c811ff055b0ed4.mp4?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <u><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into a modern world shattered by mystical artifacts. In <strong>Ready Beat Fire</strong>, every action\u2014your shots, enemies, environments, and even buffs\u2014syncs to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot to the rhythm, defeat foes, and evolve your abilities as you battle through dangerous places. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your runs, you'll find artifacts that grant you powers. Explore artifact combinations to create powerful builds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/0725b07be16dfd8c8de374ef74634012.poster.avif?t=1739929273\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/0725b07be16dfd8c8de374ef74634012.webm?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/0725b07be16dfd8c8de374ef74634012.mp4?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>UNLOCK NEW WAYS TO PLAY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons and abilities, each with its own unique traits and playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/2a263517e5f06a956ac4872304c56dd4.poster.avif?t=1739929273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/2a263517e5f06a956ac4872304c56dd4.webm?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/2a263517e5f06a956ac4872304c56dd4.mp4?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/10716e815c1d20be17c811ff055b0ed4.poster.avif?t=1739929273\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/10716e815c1d20be17c811ff055b0ed4.webm?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/10716e815c1d20be17c811ff055b0ed4.mp4?t=1739929273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
